### Validate a token (expect 200)
# Run the first request in login.http first: it saves {{token}}.
GET http://localhost:4005/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Validate a tampered token (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:4005/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}tampered

### Validate without a token (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:4005/validate

### Validate without the "Bearer " prefix (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:4005/validate
Authorization: {{token}}

###
